OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses 'cut off' after railway
OL,4,Abridge strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses in Warwickshire have said a
OL,7,Fplanned five-month road closure
OL,8,Ffollowing a bridge strike has left them
OL,9,Funable to receive deliveries.
OL,11,FThe railway bridge on Marston Lane,
OL,12,FWhitestone, was hit by a lorry on 11
OL,13,FJune and a large part of the brickwork
OL,14,Ffell away.
OL,16,FWest Coast Mainline trains continue to
OL,17,Fcross the bridge but the road beneath
OL,18,Fit has been closed to road traffic
OL,19,Fsince the incident, affecting access to
OL,20,Fthe Marston Hall Industrial Estate.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
