OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses 'cut off' after railway
OL,4,Abridge strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetwork Rail said the road closure was
OL,7,F"helping to protect local communities,
OL,8,Froad users, railway passengers and the
OL,9,Fworkforce delivering the repairs", and
OL,10,Fthat it was expected to remain in place
OL,11,Funtil November.
